Task:
Create ASG that automatically installs and configures web server using lifecycle hooks.
What to Do:
●    Create Launch Template with Amazon Linux 2023
●    Create ASG
●    Add lifecycle hook on instance launch
●    Create Lambda function that:
●    Gets triggered by lifecycle hook
●    Uses SSM Run Command to:
●    Install httpd
●    Create custom index.html with instance metadata
●    Start httpd service
●    Completes lifecycle action
●    Create CloudWatch alarm to trigger scale-out at CPU > 60%
●    Use stress command to trigger scaling
●    Verify new instances are configured automatically
Success Criteria:
●    New instances automatically have working web server
●    Scale-out happens within 5 minutes of high CPU
●    All instances show unique metadata on web page